+	/*
+	 * Both tiles are timing-identical; mirror the validated root stream.
+	 * The root shows the left half of the mode and the peer the right half
+	 * (same src size). The fit rectangle is centred on the panel, so the
+	 * right tile's dst mirrors the left one's about the seam: it starts at
